# GRUB SHIFT: an adult sparkmite sprays sparks two tiles each way when it
# pops, chaining into grubs - and into Tilly if she stands in the line.
game grubshift
wait 5
cheat contract 1 7
cheat clear
cheat chip 6 16
cheat bug 4 4 1 1
cheat bug 2 4 3 0
cheat bug 4 2 6 0
cheat use 6 4 4
expect kills == 3
expect status == 0
expect bugs == 0
cheat bug 2 0 1 1
cheat chip 6 15
cheat use 6 2 0
expect kills == 4
expect status == 2
